WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.262
Step three runs the dry run.

2
00:00:02.262 --> 00:00:08.101
One Create, two Updates, one Replace,
three NoChange and one Unmanaged.

3
00:00:08.101 --> 00:00:12.488
The checks: no findings, one
warning, one information item.

4
00:00:12.488 --> 00:00:15.676
Nothing is sent; two writes
would be sent with Apply.

5
00:00:15.676 --> 00:00:17.325
Step four reads the diff.

6
00:00:17.325 --> 00:00:22.987
The Tier 0 Global Administrator series is
an Update: its instance duration changes.

7
00:00:22.987 --> 00:00:27.438
The Privileged Role Administrator
series doesn't exist yet: Create.

8
00:00:27.438 --> 00:00:31.258
The Exchange Administrator
series changes its reviewers,

9
00:00:31.258 --> 00:00:33.363
so it's a Replace, left for a person.

10
00:00:33.363 --> 00:00:35.800
Three P R V group series match.

11
00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:40.628
The Azure Owner series is an Update too,
but it goes through a preview A P I,

12
00:00:40.628 --> 00:00:45.375
so it needs the Include Preview switch;
that's why only two writes count.

13
00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:48.760
And a Security Administrator
series in the tenant

14
00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:51.500
isn't in the file:
Unmanaged, never deleted.

15
00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.580
The bodies folder holds each
request body for a reviewer to read.
